  "diagnostic_policy":{"written_upload":"May provide indirect evidence only when a teacher-marked written response directly assesses content/argument. Do not infer pronunciation, tone or fluency from paper.","oral_evidence":"Audio/video/teacher observation required for pronunciation, intonation, fluency, delivery and interaction.","progression_note":"T4 moves from lower-secondary comprehension and discussion toward analysis, argument organisation, formal presentation, debate, issue synthesis and justified evaluation."}
